* Results to *.csv (comma-delimited-file)
export
export delimiter    tab
select              place
<>
sort                place
field               place
field               time
field header        TIME
field               last name
field               first name
field               sex
* if your database uses BIRTHDATE for the date of birth, use the following line
* instead of the lines between the *******
 field               BIRTHDATE

*******
field               MM
field header        BIRTHDATE
space               0
message             /
squeeze
space               0
field               DD
field header
space               0
message             /
squeeze
space               0
field               YY
field header
*******

field               age
field               city
field               state
field               age
